OL,4,BUK firms owed thousands as Saudi-      
OL,5,Bbacked LIV paid golfers millions       
OL,6,GLIV Golf - backed by more than $5bn    
OL,7,G(#3.8bn) from Saudi Arabia's sovereign 
OL,8,Gwealth fund - paid millions to players 
OL,9,Gand executives in the weeks before     
OL,10,Gfiling for bankruptcy, while leaving a 
OL,11,Gtrail of unpaid bills from UK          
OL,12,Gsuppliers.                             
OL,14,FBBC Sport has seen invoices from five  
OL,15,Fsmall businesses totalling hundreds of 
OL,16,Fthousands of pounds, all of which were 
OL,17,Foverdue before LIV made its final      
OL,18,Fpayments to players.                   
